  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Reserve a discovery conversation</h1>
      <p>Start with a short conversation to clarify priorities and determine whether a monthly pathway or an intensive is the better fit. There is no medical promise—only collaborative planning.</p>

      <form id="bookForm" onsubmit="return false">
        <div>
          <label for="name">Full name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="phone">Phone</label>
          <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Optional" value="{{PHONE}}">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="goal">Primary goal (brief)</label>
          <input id="goal" name="goal" placeholder="Better sleep, regain focus, reduce flare-ups...">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label>Choose a tentative time</label>
          <div class="slots" id="slots"></div>
        </div>

